### 5. Fazer Login do cliente (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### 6. Consultar cliente por ID (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{{{loginReq.response.body.token}}}}

### 7. Consultar cliente por nome (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscarNome/Ana
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Listar cliente (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Listar cliente (rota privada)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
